extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Okk8603Ll8oQ7kNvwFt_05d&_nc_oc=AdoITnlqiydI1isNIhelNjxXZGrnxs_1Rn7tT0NSem5FtwYf05Mh0GEvN7qH__jNwnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKzmHtjkexSmqk7LQliwKpKxDCsPVSL1k2yMJaUpGHskA&oe=6AA6BF56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ju3G6gbRNUcQ7kNvwHFMDxL&_nc_oc=Adq3nwGG58KTPjaNfkXnYYpOcpjgBg8mu8oOTrZ_O1KDI4MptZT-D0djQaiD0yGcQDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ7i9TX3nR8Zm8L0TE4nEMvOyenT2XYChLC3_jnTW0vHA&oe=6AA6C6A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4bEOdqJHFqgQ7kNvwHFPCAu&_nc_oc=AdpcYsANXGDs-tKf80rQTLCFMQ-uQy_EcNqSAF7uimGmbLw967EHy51-EB69YkhR1Yw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKpIskbs2imzx7OteUCx3sdieVS7me7Rz6jGeEPKbr7YQ&oe=6AA69659"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":